{
  "_note": [
    "The Campaign Season Sheet. Round counts are null wherever the booklet does",
    "not state them - the app then asks how many rounds the season has instead",
    "of assuming. Only CS III is quoted in full by the booklet (3 In Garrison,",
    "2 On Campaign), and CS VI must have at least 4 In Garrison rounds because",
    "the rules refer to 'after InG VI-4'.",
    "",
    "Season names other than III are placeholders - fill them from the sheet.",
    "",
    "Event card ids are the printed labels (numeral-number for In Garrison,",
    "numeral-letter for On Campaign). They are reference only: the app does not",
    "hold card texts, cards stay physical.",
    "",
    "forcedSeniorCommanderCommandId records the army the booklet singles out",
    "for the Senior Commander restriction in that season.",
    "",
    "Note that CS I has no Campaign Season Segment at all."
  ],
